.TH DASH 1 "January 2026" "Version 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dash \- Modern IRIX Terminal Emulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dash
[\-fn \fIfont\fP] [\-size \fIsize\fP] [\-dynbg \fImode\fP] [\-C] [\-brightness \fIval\fP] [\-theme \fIname\fP] [\-fg \fIcolor\fP] [\-bg \fIcolor\fP] [\-burn]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dash
is a Motif-based terminal emulator for IRIX, featuring OpenGL acceleration and dynamic backgrounds.
It is designed to be lightweight and visually appealing, with support for modern terminal features via libtsm.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-fn " font"
Specify the font family to use (default: courier).
.TP
.BI \-size " size"
Specify the font size in pixels (default: 14).
.TP
.BI \-dynbg " mode"
Set the dynamic background mode. Available modes are:
.RS
.IP \fInone\fP
No dynamic background (default).
.IP \fInight\fP
Starry night with shooting stars.
.IP \fIsunset\fP
Retro-wave sunset grid.
.IP \fIocean\fP
Ocean waves with fish and bubbles.
.IP \fIaurora\fP
Northern lights effect.
.IP \fIembers\fP
Rising fire embers.
.RE
.TP
.B \-C
Start in console mode. This captures /dev/console output.
.TP
.BI \-brightness " val"
Set the global brightness factor for dynamic backgrounds (default: 1.0). Useful for adjusting visibility of text against bright backgrounds.
.TP
.BI \-theme " name"
Set the color theme. Available themes: vga, vga-green, solarized, solarized-light, legacy. Default is legacy.
.TP
.BI \-fg " color"
Set the foreground color (e.g. "green", "#00FF00"). Overrides the theme color.
.TP
.BI \-bg " color"
Set the background color. Overrides the theme color.
.TP
.B \-burn
Enable maximum refresh rate (8ms interval). Useful for stress testing or burning GPU cycles.
.SH RESOURCES
The application understands the following X resources:
.TP
.B theme
Set the color theme (same as \-theme).
.TP
.B foreground
Set the foreground color (same as \-fg).
.TP
.B background
Set the background color (same as \-bg).
.TP
.B color0 through color15
Override specific palette colors (e.g. *color0: #000000).
.TP
.B fontFamily
Set the font family.
.TP
.B fontSize
Set the font size.
.TP
.B dynamicBackground
Set the dynamic background mode.
.TP
.B brightness
Set the background brightness.
.TP
.B redrawInterval
Set the redraw interval in milliseconds.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.SS Scrolling
.TP
.B Shift+PageUp
Scroll up one page.
.TP
.B Shift+PageDown
Scroll down one page.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+Up
Scroll up one line.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+Down
Scroll down one line.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+PageUp
Scroll up one page.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+PageDown
Scroll down one page.
.SS Zooming
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+Plus (+)
Zoom in.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+Minus (-)
Zoom out.
.SS Tabs
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+1..9
Switch to tabs 1 through 9.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+0
Switch to tab 10.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+Tab
Cycle to the next tab.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+N
Open new terminal tab.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+W
Close current tab.
.SH MOUSE ACTIONS
.TP
.B Left Click & Drag
Select text. Text is automatically copied to the clipboard on release.
.TP
.B Middle Click
Paste text from the clipboard.
.SH AUTHOR
Written by a very good cat.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR X (1)